#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:9
msgid "电机计算、轴目标与硬件执行"
msgstr "Motor computation, axis targets and hardware execution"

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:11
msgid ""
"Nexus 将电机计算、轴目标和硬件执行分别交给可选 C11 组件、外部应用桥和唯一 "
"provider。本文说明当前软件合同及其成本，不把软件参考配置授予任何功率板、 电机或物理控制资格。"
msgstr ""
"Nexus assigns motor computation, axis targets and hardware execution to "
"optional C11 components, an explicit application bridge and one provider. "
"This page describes the current software contracts and their costs; a "
"software reference does not qualify any power board, motor or physical "
"controller."

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:15
msgid ""
"当前生产接入范围限定为 STM32F4。GD32F470 与其他非 F4 MCU 不在本轮实现范围； 保留厂商依赖库存和公共接口边界，不建立占位 "
"provider，也不据此声称跨厂商验证。"
msgstr ""
"Production integration is currently limited to STM32F4. GD32F470 and other "
"non-F4 MCUs are outside this implementation scope. Vendor inventory "
"dependencies and public interface boundaries remain; no placeholder provider"
" or cross-vendor qualification is claimed."

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:18
msgid "![FIG-35：电机与轴控制的调用和退出责任](../assets/diagrams/motor-control.svg)"
msgstr ""
"![FIG-35: Motor and axis control calls and withdrawal "
"responsibilities](../assets/diagrams/motor-control.svg)"

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:18
msgid "FIG-35：电机与轴控制的调用和退出责任"
msgstr "FIG-35: Motor and axis control calls and withdrawal responsibilities"

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:20
msgid ""
"FIG-35 表达当前可选组合：实线是显式调用或数据交付，虚线是借用和退出责任。 图不要求应用启用全部节点；精确 F407ZG 参考、源路径和边界见 "
"{ref}`图册 <fig-35-motor-control>`。"
msgstr ""
"FIG-35 shows the current optional composition: solid lines are explicit "
"calls or data delivery; dashed lines are borrowing and withdrawal "
"responsibilities. Applications need not enable every node. See the "
"{ref}`diagram catalog <fig-35-motor-control>` for the exact F407ZG "
"reference, source paths and limits."

