#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:36
msgid ""
"组件不创建堆、任务、全局时钟或电机注册表。控制数学不包含 HAL；provider 使用私有 厂商类型和经审核的硬件操作。组件 target "
"仅在被明确链接时进入镜像，实例状态由 调用者提供，未选模式不承担其最大缓冲与运行状态。"
msgstr ""
"Components create no heap, tasks, global clock or motor registry. Control "
"mathematics contains no HAL; the provider uses private vendor types and "
"reviewed hardware operations. Component targets enter the image only when "
"explicitly linked. Callers supply instance state; unselected modes pay no "
"maximum-buffer or runtime-state cost."

