#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:0
msgid "CANopen／CiA402"
msgstr "CANopen/CiA402"

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:0
msgid "单个 Thread 执行者，先完成协议 step，再提供有效轴事实"
msgstr ""
"One Thread executor; complete the protocol step before supplying valid axis "
"facts"

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:48
msgid "一份决定不等于一个物理结果"
msgstr "A decision is not a physical result"

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:50
msgid ""
"应用分别保留原始请求、受约束参考、软件采用、输出计划和测量。Axis 的 `adopted_at` 描述其执行者采用目标的时刻；Motor "
"的输出是归一化 duty 和计划电压。 provider 接受完整 shadow 组，也不证明对应物理边沿已经发生。"
msgstr ""
"Applications retain the original request, constrained reference, software "
"adoption, output plan and measurement separately. Axis `adopted_at` "
"describes when its executor adopts a target; Motor produces normalized duty "
"and planned voltage. Even acceptance of a complete shadow group by the "
"provider does not prove that the physical edge occurred."

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:54
msgid ""
"`nx_motor_voltage_step` 单独产生电流环电压决策，不生成 duty，由选定调制器联合 "
"决定开关和采样计划。`nx_motor_step` 保留固定 min/max 共模调制入口；调用者仍须 "
"验证所选硬件窗口。两种入口共用数值与故障合同，不在同一周期先后推进同一实例。"
msgstr ""
"`nx_motor_voltage_step` separately produces a current-loop voltage decision "
"without duty. A selected modulator jointly determines switching and capture "
"plans. `nx_motor_step` retains fixed min/max common-mode modulation; callers"
" still validate the selected hardware window. Both entries share numerical "
"and fault contracts; do not advance the same instance through both in one "
"cycle."

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:58
msgid ""
"位置、速度、电流、机械角、电角和转矩不能混用。齿比、编码器计数倍率、方向和极对数 分别有明确来源。应用桥将 Axis 选定机械侧的角度和速度换算为 "
"Motor 要求的转子 机械侧，再由电机计算应用极对数；电流参考的单位是 A，不按齿比折算。没有核验转矩 常数与电流约定时，安培目标不能改名为转矩反馈。"
msgstr ""
"Position, velocity, current, mechanical angle, electrical angle and torque "
"are distinct. Gear ratio, encoder count multiplier, direction and pole pairs"
" each need an explicit source. The application bridge converts the angle and"
" velocity from the mechanical side selected for Axis to the rotor mechanical"
" side required by Motor; motor computation then applies the pole pairs. The "
"current reference is in A and is never scaled by the gear ratio. Without "
"verified torque constants and current conventions, an ampere target cannot "
"be renamed torque feedback."

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:63
msgid "采样、观察与计划输出分别计时"
msgstr "Time sampling, observation and planned output separately"

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:65
msgid ""
"Motor 输入区分 `sample_time_us`、`angle_time_us`、`observed_at_us` 和 "
"`apply_time_us`。角度可以在采样之后、观察之前取得，随后在明确误差预算内向采样 "
"时刻回投影或向输出时刻预测。预测使用调用者提供的有效机械速度；软件读取时刻 不自动成为采样孔径。"
msgstr ""
"Motor input distinguishes `sample_time_us`, `angle_time_us`, "
"`observed_at_us` and `apply_time_us`. The angle may be obtained after "
"sampling and before observation, then projected back to sampling or forward "
"to output within an explicit error budget. Prediction uses caller-supplied "
"valid mechanical velocity; a software-read time does not automatically "
"become a sampling aperture."

