#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:84
msgid ""
"`current_phase_mask` 标识真正测量的逻辑相位，未选槽填零不成为测量。只有 `bus_valid`／`encoder_valid` "
"为真时，才能消费相应字段。`sample_at` 是计划触发 参考，`trigger_ticks` 保留细粒度载波坐标，`scan_span_us` "
"是声明的转换跨度。 应用组合说明采样偏差与角度估计的适用范围，不靠重写时间戳伪造同步。"
msgstr ""
"`current_phase_mask` identifies the logical phases actually measured; zero-"
"filled unselected slots are not measurements. Consume the corresponding "
"fields only when `bus_valid`/`encoder_valid` is true. `sample_at` is a "
"scheduled trigger reference, `trigger_ticks` retains the finer carrier "
"coordinate, and `scan_span_us` is the declared conversion span. The "
"application composition qualifies sampling skew and angle estimation; "
"relabeling timestamps cannot create synchronization."

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:89
msgid ""
"DC-link profile 的相电流 count／mask 为零，`dc` 提供同一已采用计划的两个原始 "
"母线电流码、开关矢量和计划采集坐标。`scan_span_us` 覆盖两触发间隔及末次转换， 不能把它解释为一条 ADC rank "
"的时间。计划坐标仍不是实测模拟孔径，应用使用有界 组时序换算；独立母线电压来源与母线分流电流是不同测量。"
msgstr ""
"A DC-link profile has zero phase-current count/mask. `dc` supplies two raw "
"DC-link current codes, switching vectors and scheduled capture coordinates "
"from the same adopted plan. `scan_span_us` covers the interval between both "
"triggers and the final conversion; it is not the duration of one ADC rank. "
"Scheduled coordinates are still not measured analog apertures: the "
"application converts them using qualified bounded group timing. A separate "
"DC-bus voltage source and DC-link shunt current are different measurements."

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:94
msgid ""
"有效窗口同时受 duty、deadtime、模拟稳定时间、转换、IRQ 延迟、compute 和提交 预算约束。调制器的数学余量不能代替 "
"provider 的窗口检查，更不能证明真实模拟 稳定时间。所选 provider 必须明确其完整映射能力，不能从数学规划推导中心对齐、 多 ADC "
"同时采样、单分流或无感换相的硬件支持。"
msgstr ""
"Duty, deadtime, analog settling, conversion, IRQ latency, compute and "
"submission budgets jointly constrain the valid window. Mathematical "
"modulation margin cannot replace provider window checks or prove actual "
"analog settling. The selected provider must declare its complete mapping "
"capability; mathematical planning cannot establish hardware support for "
"center alignment, simultaneous multi-ADC sampling, single shunt or "
"sensorless commutation."

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:99
msgid "电流观测和调制共同规划"
msgstr "Current observation and modulation are planned together"

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:101
msgid ""
"Current 接收明确身份与 revision 的标定，把逻辑相位原始码换算为 A。独立测量的 "
"三相可以检查相电流和；从两相重构第三相时，和为零是计算恒等式，不能作为独立 传感器诊断。单分流还必须关联同一已采用计划中的两个有效开关矢量。饱和、无效 "
"窗口、过大孔径偏差或标定身份不匹配都不能产生有效电流。"
msgstr ""
"Current accepts calibration with explicit identity and revision and converts"
" logical phase codes to A. Three independent phase measurements may use "
"their sum for consistency. Reconstructing a third phase from two makes a "
"zero sum an identity, not independent sensor diagnosis. Single-shunt "
"reconstruction also associates two active switching vectors with the same "
"adopted plan. Saturation, invalid windows, excessive aperture skew or "
"mismatched calibration identity cannot produce valid current."

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:106
msgid ""
"时序明确分为 `NX_CURRENT_APERTURES_EXPLICIT` 和 `NX_CURRENT_APERTURES_BOUNDED`。 "
"前者使用真实孔径，后者保留合格的组参考与正偏差上界，不读取或填造逐相孔径。 仅知道计划触发和 scan span "
"时使用后者，不能将软件时间代理升级为实测同时采样。"
msgstr ""
"Timing explicitly distinguishes `NX_CURRENT_APERTURES_EXPLICIT` from "
"`NX_CURRENT_APERTURES_BOUNDED`. The former uses actual apertures; the latter"
" retains a qualified group reference and a positive skew bound without "
"reading or fabricating per-phase apertures. Use bounded timing when only the"
" scheduled trigger and scan span are known; a software time proxy does not "
"establish measured simultaneous capture."

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:110
msgid ""
"Modulation 用整载波 tick 坐标共同确定脉宽、起点、采样窗口和最终理想平均电压。 模拟恢复、采样保持、ADC 占用和 CPU "
"提交分别预算；没有有效窗口就拒绝，输出 保持不变。可选固定相移只是一种规划候选，实际 provider 必须完整映射脉冲起点 与采样安排，不得只取 "
"duty 或重新静默裁剪。"
msgstr ""
"Modulation jointly determines pulse widths, starts, capture windows and "
"final ideal average voltage in full-carrier tick coordinates. Analog "
"recovery, sample-and-hold, ADC occupation and CPU submission have separate "
"budgets. A missing valid window rejects without changing output. An optional"
" fixed phase shift is only a planning candidate; the actual provider must "
"map pulse starts and capture arrangements completely, never taking duty "
"alone or silently clamping again."

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:115
msgid ""
"选定 provider 给出可用采集槽，规划器还要求触发、完整结果及 rearm 都留在该槽。 "
"例如中心参考只开放下降段，不能选中数学上可观测但硬件未开放的上升段。"
msgstr ""
"The selected provider supplies the available capture slot. The planner also "
"requires the trigger, complete result and rearm to remain inside it. For "
"example, the center reference opens only the descending half; it cannot "
"select a mathematically observable but unopened ascending half."

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:118
msgid ""
"纯 C 规划的中心对齐、双／单分流能力不自动授予对应 F4 硬件模式。具体器件、 路线、capture profile、提交方式及验证范围仍由所选 "
"provider 决定。"
msgstr ""
"Pure-C center-alignment and two/single-shunt planning do not qualify the "
"corresponding F4 hardware modes. The selected provider still determines "
"exact parts, routes, capture profiles, submission and verification scope."

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:121
msgid ""
"选定 F4 DC-link mapper 只接受边沿对齐、无相移的完整脉冲。首计划必须显式包含 两个独立有效矢量；中性等 duty "
"不能建立采样。初始与后续 DC descriptor 均位于 声明的完整会话 context 内，不能指向 callback 栈；provider "
"验证后复制，不保留 临时计划指针。零电压等退化要求若没有可观测窗口就返回 `UNSUPPORTED`，不能靠 "
"虚构电流或隐含激励维持运行。固定相移仍只是规划候选，没有对应 mapper 就不开放。"
msgstr ""
"The selected F4 DC-link mapper accepts only complete edge-aligned pulses "
"without shifts. The initial plan must explicitly contain two independent "
"active vectors; neutral equal duties cannot establish capture. Initial and "
"subsequent DC descriptors reside in the complete declared session context, "
"never callback stack storage. The provider validates and copies them without"
" retaining temporary plan pointers. A degenerate request such as zero "
"voltage returns `UNSUPPORTED` when no observable window exists; fabricated "
"current or implicit excitation cannot keep it running. Fixed shifts remain "
"planning candidates and are not exposed without a corresponding mapper."

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:127
msgid "三种期限保持独立"
msgstr "Keep three kinds of deadline independent"

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:129
msgid "外部命令有效期决定旧运动参考还能否使用，重复帧和心跳不自动续期。"
msgstr ""
"External command validity determines whether an old motion reference remains"
" usable. Repeated frames and heartbeats do not automatically renew it."

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:130
msgid ""
"PowerStage 用单独的 `startup_deadline` 约束启动；非阻塞长期 session 的 `base.deadline` 为 "
"`NX_DEADLINE_NEVER`，运行直到显式停止或故障。"
msgstr ""
"PowerStage bounds startup with a separate `startup_deadline`. The "
"nonblocking long-lived session uses `NX_DEADLINE_NEVER` for `base.deadline` "
"and runs until explicit stop or fault."

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:132
msgid "service、清理尝试和维护使用各自有界执行；超时不能撤销借用或证明已经断能。"
msgstr ""
"Service, cleanup attempts and maintenance each have bounded execution. "
"Timeout cannot revoke a borrow or prove deenergization."

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:134
msgid ""
"Task 通过显式 service 推进启动及最终排空；选定 ADC IRQ 只执行有界 callback。 任务不得逐字段改动被 IRQ "
"借用的算法状态。跨上下文目标与参数通过已有有界对象 交接，普通结构体复制不构成同步协议。软件只能在 callback 返回后检测其超预算， 不能用 "
"deadline 抢占一个不返回的计算。"
msgstr ""
"The Task explicitly services startup and final drainage; the selected ADC "
"IRQ executes only a bounded callback. Tasks must not change algorithm state "
"borrowed by the IRQ field by field. Cross-context targets and parameters "
"pass through an existing bounded object handoff; an ordinary structure copy "
"is not a synchronization protocol. Software can detect a callback budget "
"overrun only after it returns. A deadline cannot preempt computation that "
"never returns."

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:139
msgid "参考、连续反馈和遥测各有通道"
msgstr "References, continuous feedback and telemetry have separate channels"

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:141
msgid ""
"Drive 使用调用者提供的固定容量 SPSC：一个 Task 发布完整有限参考，一个快环 执行者每步最多采用一条。队列满时拒绝，原始 receipt "
"不随排队刷新。独立 inhibit 不等待参考队列空间；真正的硬件抑制和退出仍由 provider 完成。"
msgstr ""
"Drive uses caller-provided fixed-capacity SPSC storage: one Task publishes "
"complete finite references, and one fast executor adopts at most one per "
"step. A full queue rejects; queuing never refreshes the original receipt. "
"Independent inhibit does not wait for reference space. The provider still "
"performs actual hardware inhibition and withdrawal."

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:145
msgid ""
"Drive 的参数 revision 标识停机初始化的 Motor profile，与 Axis 参数 revision "
"分别管理。生产者只能交付完整记录，不能访问 IRQ 正在借用的 Motor 或 Drive。 参考接纳、快环采用、输出 staged "
"和物理结果分别观察。"
msgstr ""
"Drive parameter revisions identify a stopped-initialized Motor profile, "
"separately from Axis parameter revisions. Producers deliver complete records"
" and cannot access Motor or Drive while the IRQ borrows them. Reference "
"admission, fast adoption, staged output and physical results are separate "
"observations."

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:149
msgid ""
"反馈分频保留实际区间和快环覆盖，丢周期、区间断裂或队列溢出锁存故障，不能靠 读取旧记录或重编 sequence 修复。`accepted_iq_a` "
"是某个 generation 采用的参考， 不是实测电流；下游 tracking 必须匹配原 Axis 决策，不能回算到更新的决策。 "
"可丢遥测使用独立对象，不参与连续控制反馈的资格判断。"
msgstr ""
"Feedback decimation retains actual intervals and fast coverage. Missing "
"cycles, interval gaps or queue overflow latch faults; reading old records or"
" renumbering sequences cannot repair them. `accepted_iq_a` is the reference "
"adopted for a generation, not measured current. Downstream tracking must "
"match the original Axis decision, never a newer one. Droppable telemetry "
"uses a separate object and does not establish continuous-feedback "
"qualification."

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:154
msgid ""
"共母线预算计算分别限制消费与回生功率，不假定两轴相抵消。它只计算缩放；产品 提供带有效期的预算、实施限幅并反馈下游采用。供电吸收能力、制动硬件和机械 "
"停车仍需实际证明，软件预算不充当快速过压／过流保护。"
msgstr ""
"Common-bus budgeting limits consumption and regeneration separately, without"
" assuming cancellation between axes. It only computes scales. The product "
"supplies finite budgets, applies limits and tracks downstream acceptance. "
"Supply absorption, braking hardware and mechanical stopping still need "
"actual evidence; software budgets do not provide fast "
"overvoltage/overcurrent protection."

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:158
msgid "标定资格与参数采用"
msgstr "Calibration qualification and parameter adoption"

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:160
msgid ""
"偏置、AFE 增益／方向、相序、编码器方向和电角偏移分别建立来源。稳定偏置、零 PWM 或输出关闭不能单独证明零电流。Current 的标定身份和 "
"revision 只检查匹配， 不认证硬件，也不自行写存储或授予激励。外部组合默认未投入运行，必须先核对 实际传感链、电机与参数身份。"
msgstr ""
"Offsets, AFE gain/direction, phase order, encoder direction and electrical "
"offset have separate sources. Stable offsets, zero PWM or inhibited output "
"alone cannot prove zero current. Current checks calibration identity and "
"revision only for a match; it neither authenticates hardware nor writes "
"storage or authorizes excitation. External compositions default to "
"uncommissioned and first verify the actual sensor chain, motor and parameter"
" identity."

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:165
msgid ""
"运动参考运行中交接；Motor profile 和标定在退出并会合后重新初始化。Axis 按其 公共合同独立采用参数 "
"revision，不能将其版本号当作 Drive 的停机 profile 版本。 持久化由普通维护路径处理；F407 控制期间不因此获得未审核的内部 "
"Flash 写擦资格。"
msgstr ""
"Motion references transfer during operation; Motor profiles and calibration "
"are reinitialized after withdrawal and join. Axis independently adopts "
"parameter revisions under its public contract; its version is not the "
"stopped Drive profile version. Persistence belongs to ordinary maintenance. "
"This does not authorize unreviewed internal Flash programming or erasure "
"during F407 control."

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:169
msgid "每轴状态与共享硬件域"
msgstr "Per-axis state and the shared hardware domain"

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:171
msgid ""
"每轴分别拥有算法、会话、参数和故障。配置中的显式 `domain` 把共同 ADC 设置、 门钟和 IRQ 交给一个静态 owner。Factory "
"只返回既有 face，不创建第二个 owner。 当前独立 ADC 共享域检查共同配置和串行计算预算；它没有合成动态调度器。"
msgstr ""
"Each axis owns its algorithm, session, parameters and faults. The explicit "
"configuration `domain` assigns common ADC settings, gates and IRQ to one "
"static owner. Factory lookup returns existing faces without creating another"
" owner. The current independent-ADC domain checks common configuration and "
"serial compute budgets; it synthesizes no dynamic scheduler."

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:175
msgid ""
"同 ADC 时分参考由共同域明确持有当前 capture owner。两会话先完成接纳与准备， "
"再按完整载波的固定半周期偏移启动；每个时隙覆盖转换、IRQ、计算和重新装载。 公共 ADC IRQ 只分发给已发布 "
"owner，不能按当前寄存器猜测归属。单轴退出不 撤回另一轴已获得的时隙；来源不再可信时关闭共同域准入。该选定实现已有生产 C 模型和 ARM "
"链接证据，启动容差与物理周期仍需实板验证。"
msgstr ""
"The shared domain explicitly owns the current capture owner for the same-ADC"
" time-sharing reference. Both sessions first complete admission and "
"preparation, then start at a fixed nominal half-carrier offset. Each slot "
"covers conversion, IRQ, computation and rearming. The shared ADC IRQ "
"dispatches only to the published owner, without inferring ownership from "
"current registers. Stopping one axis does not withdraw the other axis's "
"granted slot; an untrustworthy source closes admission to the shared domain."
" This selected implementation has production C model and ARM link evidence; "
"startup tolerance and physical periods still require hardware verification."

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:181
msgid ""
"共享域及其成员的生命周期操作使用同一个普通上下文执行者，或由应用显式共同 串行化；不能从每个 face 各自串行推导跨 Task "
"并发启停。快环保持其单一执行者， 平台不为此添加隐藏 OS 锁。"
msgstr ""
"The shared domain and all its members use one ordinary-context executor for "
"lifecycle operations, or explicit common serialization supplied by the "
"application. Serializing each face separately does not authorize concurrent "
"lifecycle calls from different Tasks. The fast loop retains its sole "
"executor; the platform adds no hidden OS lock."

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:185
msgid ""
"停止一轴先抑制其输出、撤回采集与回调，再移除其发布资格。其他成员仍运行时， 不能复位共同 ADC 或 detach 整个 "
"IRQ。最后一轴退出后才归还共同效果；恢复失败 保留逐项 receipt。共同模式不再可信时，所有受影响成员关闭准入并抑制输出。"
msgstr ""
"Stopping one axis first inhibits its output, withdraws capture and "
"callbacks, then removes its publication. While peers run, it cannot reset "
"common ADC state or detach the whole IRQ. Common effects return only after "
"the last axis exits; failed restoration retains individual receipts. If "
"common mode is no longer trustworthy, every affected member closes admission"
" and inhibits output."

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:189
msgid "故障与退出沿着原 owner 完成"
msgstr "Faults and withdrawal follow the original owner"

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:191
msgid ""
"计算错误、角度过期、非法采样或完整输出失败关闭相应准入。Motor 算法故障不能 替代硬件抑制；应用仍按 PowerStage 合同 "
"stop／service。输出关闭后，session 和 全部 context 仍保留到 acquire 观察 `SETTLED`。退出失败保持 "
"`QUARANTINED`， 不能清零状态后复用，也不能用恢复同一个 epoch 数值伪装新会话。"
msgstr ""
"Computation errors, stale angles, invalid samples or failed complete outputs"
" close the corresponding admission. A Motor algorithm fault cannot replace "
"hardware inhibition; the application must still stop/service under the "
"PowerStage contract. After output inhibition, the session and all context "
"remain borrowed until an acquire observation of `SETTLED`. Failed withdrawal"
" retains `QUARANTINED`: storage cannot be zeroed and reused, and restoring "
"the same epoch value cannot masquerade as a new session."

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:196
msgid ""
"受控减速依赖仍有效的反馈、供电和能量处理。硬件 stop 是输出与源撤回，不是机械 "
"减速或功率隔离。升降承重、抱闸、机械回零和整机重新启动条件属于外部应用；电角 偏置、编码器参考和机械零位分别建立有效性。"
msgstr ""
"Controlled deceleration requires feedback, supply and energy handling that "
"remain valid. Hardware stop withdraws outputs and sources; it does not "
"promise mechanical deceleration or power isolation. Load support, brakes, "
"mechanical homing and whole-machine restart conditions belong to the "
"external application. Electrical offset, encoder reference and mechanical "
"zero establish their validity separately."

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:200
msgid "软件项目提供各自范围的证据"
msgstr "Software projects provide evidence within their own scope"

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:202
msgid ""
"独立示例仓库的双轮 SIL 运行实际 C 控制和独立 DC／机械模型；控制器只看模拟 "
"传感器，验收器可以读取模型真值。轮速、里程计和地面真值分别报告。固定窗口缺样 不能填成零误差；课程参数只属于明确的教学 profile。"
msgstr ""
"The external differential-drive SIL executes actual C control with an "
"independent DC/mechanical model. The controller sees simulated sensors; the "
"evaluator may read model truth. Wheel velocity, odometry and ground truth "
"are reported separately. Missing samples in a fixed window cannot become "
"zero error. Course parameters belong only to an explicit teaching profile."

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:206
msgid ""
"`recipes/control/dual_motor_drive` 另用两个独立平均 PMSM 电气／机械模型，量化 ADC 与编码器反馈给实际 "
"Axis／Drive／Current／Motor／Modulation 组合。电流、 速度和位置目标、Task 失联及单轴采样故障走同一生产 C "
"组合；这不是把原 DC 模型改名，也不证明 STM32F4 的物理双轴时序。"
msgstr ""
"`recipes/control/dual_motor_drive` uses two separate average PMSM "
"electrical/mechanical models. Quantized ADC and encoder observations feed "
"the actual Axis/Drive/Current/Motor/Modulation composition. Current, "
"velocity and position commands, Task loss and a single-axis capture fault "
"run through the same production C composition. This does not rename the "
"earlier DC model or prove physical STM32F4 dual-axis timing."

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:211
msgid ""
"`motor_drive` 可选 AS5047P Task 采集，通过独立有界角度通道交给快环；默认 消费者不因此链接 "
"SPI。换坐标、重新绑定或复位通道前先会合 reader 和快环， 不得把旧缓存与新映射混用。整数位移是多圈权威，软件观察时间与实际孔径分开。"
msgstr ""
"`motor_drive` optionally acquires AS5047P observations in a Task and hands "
"them to the fast loop through a separate bounded angle channel; the default "
"consumer does not thereby link SPI. Join the reader and fast loop before "
"changing coordinates, rebinding or resetting the channel. Never combine an "
"old cache with a new mapping. Integer displacement is authoritative for "
"multiple turns; software observation time remains distinct from the actual "
"aperture."

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:215
msgid ""
"可选 INA226 母线来源同样由 Task 采集，每轴使用独立有界通道。有效期从实际 转换开始的保守时间下界计算，不能从 "
"poll、发布或读取缓存的时刻续期；它不是 快速相电流采样或硬件过压保护。快环还要求母线资格覆盖计划输出边界，源故障 即使队列已满也独立关闭缓存准入。"
msgstr ""
"An optional INA226 DC-bus source is also acquired in a Task, using a "
"separate bounded channel per axis. Validity starts at the conservative lower"
" bound of the actual conversion start; polling, publication and cached reads"
" cannot renew it. This is neither fast phase-current capture nor hardware "
"overvoltage protection. The fast loop additionally requires DC-bus validity "
"through the planned output boundary; source faults independently close cache"
" admission even when the queue is full."

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:220
msgid ""
"`recipes/network/cia402_motor` 用同一个 Task 把真实 CANopen／CiA402 的选定 PV／绝对 PP "
"接到该控制组合。实际 RPDO 的原始本地 receipt 产生有限候选，且 受独立产品授权限制；SDO、心跳和协议轮询不续期。PP 确认等待匹配的快环"
" `command_sequence`，reset 只提出恢复请求，不启动硬件。该 Native 组合委托 原 CAN "
"owner；退出失败保留协议与电驱两边的借用。"
msgstr ""
"`recipes/network/cia402_motor` uses one Task to connect selected real "
"CANopen/CiA402 PV and absolute PP profiles to this control composition. The "
"original local receipt of an actual RPDO creates a finite candidate bounded "
"by independent product authority. SDO, heartbeats and protocol polling do "
"not renew it. PP acknowledgement waits for a matching fast-loop "
"`command_sequence`; reset requests recovery without starting hardware. This "
"Native composition delegates to the original CAN owner; failed withdrawal "
"retains both protocol and drive loans."

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:226
msgid ""
"PMSM 数学模型、生产 C 寄存器模型、ARM 链接、安装 SDK 消费和物理测量是不同 证据。DC 模型通过不授予 PMSM 或实板能力；当前物理 "
"HIL 保持 `not_executed`。 MCSDK 不是自有控制核的依赖，尚未接入的后端也不占位声明为已支持。"
msgstr ""
"PMSM mathematical models, production-C register models, ARM linking, "
"installed-SDK consumption and physical measurements provide different "
"evidence. Passing a DC model does not qualify PMSM operation or a board; "
"physical HIL remains `not_executed`. MCSDK is not a dependency of the self-"
"owned kernel. Unintegrated backends are not advertised as supported "
"placeholders."

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:230
msgid "本轮验收沿用 FOC 工作包，不建立另一套资格台账："
msgstr ""
"This iteration retains the FOC work packages rather than creating another "
"qualification ledger:"

#: ../../../../../docs/explanation/motor-control.md:0
msgid "工作范围"
